series.description:
2B Creampied (HydraFXX #27) is a short 3D CGI adult fan animation by HydraFXX featuring 2B from NieR:Automata. The work presents an unofficial adult-oriented scenario centered on the YoRHa No. 2 Type B character.

Released as a single completed entry on May 30, 2021, the animation uses 3D CGI character models and environments to depict 2B in an explicit scenario. HydraFXX is known for creating 3D artwork and animations, with their public portfolio containing multiple works featuring 2B and other NieR:Automata characters. :contentReference[oaicite:1]{index=1}

The animation is a fan-made work and is not part of the official NieR:Automata storyline.
